  Title: AI-Powered Neuroimaging Analysis Shows Promise for Early Detection of Alzheimer's
  Source: RSNA
  URL: https://www.rsna.org/news/ai-powered-neuroimaging-analysis-shows-promise-early-detection-alzheimers
  Category: neuro
  Importance: 95
  ai_summary: "A new study demonstrates AI algorithms can accurately identify subtle neuroimaging markers indicative of early Alzheimer's disease, potentially enabling earlier intervention and improved patient outcomes. This represents a significant step forward in leveraging AI for proactive neurological care."
  Title: Lung Nodule Detection Accuracy Enhanced by Deep Learning on Chest CTs
  Source: RadioGraphics
  URL: https://www.radiographics.org/content/46/1/XXX/full/X.short
  Category: chest
  Importance: 90
  ai_summary: "Deep learning models are now achieving near-human performance in detecting lung nodules on chest CTs, reducing false positives and potentially improving early cancer diagnosis. This has substantial implications for workflow efficiency and patient management."
  Title: ACR Releases Updated Guidelines for Breast Imaging Quality
  Source: ACR
  URL: https://www.acr.org/Advocacy-Government-Relations/News/Press-Releases/ACR-Releases-Updated-Guidelines-for-Breast-Imaging-Quality
  Category: msk
  Importance: 85
  ai_summary: "The American College of Radiology has updated its guidelines for breast imaging, emphasizing factors contributing to image quality and patient safety. These revisions reflect advancements in technology and aim to ensure optimal diagnostic accuracy."
  Title: Cannabis-Based Medicines Show No Benefit for Neuropathic Pain: Major Review
  Source: AuntMinnie
  URL: https://www.auntminnie.com/news/product/cannabis-based-medicines-show-no-benefit-neuropathic-pain
  Category: ir
  Importance: 80
